{
 "_readme": "Where internship postings come from. 'employers' are candidate companies on public job-board systems (Greenhouse, Lever, Workable). They were listed from general knowledge and are UNVERIFIED: the run asks each one live, publishes only what it actually returns, and lists the ones that do not exist in the report so they can be removed. Add a company by adding {name, ats, slug}: the slug is the last part of its careers page address on that system. 'blockedByRobots' holds Ashby and SmartRecruiters employers: those two systems forbid automated reading of their job data in robots.txt, so we do not ask them. 'openFeeds' are public-sector or open feeds. 'portals' are link-only: we do not read them, we only check that the link loads, and the report records each site's robots.txt for later review.",
